+///   14 minutes at the deployed 30 s interval (`cli.rs` `DEFAULT_CUSTODIAN_INTERVAL_SECS`).
+///   Every pass lists the whole fleet whatever `B` is, so a smaller budget would only add
+///   passes to each lap.
